<view class="profile-page ui-page"><view class="profile-heading"><text>做喜欢的自己</text><view>你的元享，<text>由你定义。</text></view></view><yx-state wx:if="{{profileBusy&&!profileLoaded}}" type="loading"/><block wx:else><view class="profile-avatar-wrap"><button class="profile-avatar-button" bindchooseavatar="upface" disabled="{{avatarBusy}}" open-type="chooseAvatar"><image wx:if="{{avatarPreview||userinfo.headimg}}" src="{{avatarPreview||userinfo.headimg}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="avatarError"/><view wx:else class="profile-avatar-placeholder"><yx-icon name="user" tone="brand" size="86"/></view><view class="profile-avatar-camera"><yx-icon name="image" tone="light" size="34"/></view></button><text class="profile-avatar-label">{{avatarBusy?'头像正在保存…':'更换头像'}}</text><text class="profile-avatar-caption">头像由你自主选择</text><button class="profile-album" bindtap="chooseAlbumAvatar" disabled="{{avatarBusy}}">从手机相册选择</button></view><view class="profile-fields"><text>昵称</text><input type="nickname" class="profile-input" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="changename" bindblur="nicknamereview" maxlength="30" placeholder="使用你喜欢的名字" disabled="{{profileBusy}}"/><text>使用你喜欢的名字，最多30个字。</text></view></block><view wx:if="{{profileError}}" class="profile-error"><yx-icon name="info" tone="brand" size="32"/><text>{{profileError}}</text><button bindtap="refreshProfile" disabled="{{profileBusy||avatarBusy}}">重试读取</button></view><view class="profile-note"><yx-icon name="shield" tone="brand" size="38"/><text>头像和昵称均为选填，<text>不影响签到、赚金币和商品兑换。</text><text>头像选择后单独保存，昵称需点击下方保存。</text></text></view><button bindtap="skipProfile" class="profile-skip">暂不完善，继续浏览</button><view class="profile-footer"><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="tijiao" disabled="{{profileBusy||avatarBusy}}" loading="{{profileBusy}}">保存昵称</button></view></view>
